; Loop-carried MFMA accumulators pinned to AGPRs with "=a,0" inline asm. After
; AMDGPURewriteAGPRCopyMFMA rewrites the chain to the AGPR form, the copy left
; by PHI elimination is joined with its source so the loop does not carry the
; accumulator through v_accvgpr_mov. In swap_pin_d only one of the two MFMAs is
; rewritten, so the other accumulator still goes through v_accvgpr_write and
; v_accvgpr_read.

